(text "RP5C01 RTC — 4-BIT REGISTERS, CR2032 BACKUP" (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4c5b8add-e380-5e1f-b2c6-9a34387e5275"))
(text "U11 pin 1 /CS: GAL decode. Pin 2 CS: main-power-good (LOW in backup).\nFD15 selects an index; FD14 reads/writes the low nibble. This differs from DS12887 software." (at 20 33 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1b855e57-e7ae-55a8-b6b4-6871e3d24a88"))
(text "Oscillator follows original Ricoh RP5C01 databook page 3-6, including 56pF on OSCOUT.\nCrystal load and trimmer require calibration. Keep oscillator components together, away from digital clocks.\nMAX690A powers only U11 from CR2032. WDI is intentionally open; PFI grounded; PFO unused." (at 20 132 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d1401800-aec7-5595-b524-aa1cc58b2d34"))
(text "R20-R30 bias RTC inputs during backup. Measure battery current, time retention and supply switching on the prototype." (at 20 239 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2b8180a7-b401-5046-b9fa-f8e7b5132a4b"))
(embedded_fonts no))
